  "rationale": [
    "Teal is 50° from both the success green and the info blue, so actions never read as status.",
    "17px base: patients and older users read forms; the display ratio is modest (1.25) to stay calm.",
    "A warm coral signature balances the clinical teal (complementary temperature) for human moments only."
  ],
